cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the versioned release."
title: "Prediction–Planning Consistent LSTM-Enhanced MPC-DWA for UAV Dynamic Obstacle Avoidance"
version: "1.1.1"
date-released: "2026-09-28"
type: software
abstract: >-
  MATLAB and CasADi source code for an LSTM-enhanced MPC-DWA framework for
  three-dimensional UAV dynamic-obstacle avoidance. The code includes
  trajectory generation, LSTM prediction, time-aligned MPC/DWA injection,
  matched closed-loop comparisons, sensing-pressure tests, random-scene
  evaluation and audit-oriented result export.
authors:
  - family-names: Fu
    given-names: Zhenhui
keywords:
  - UAV
  - dynamic obstacle avoidance
  - model predictive control
  - dynamic window approach
  - LSTM
  - trajectory prediction
repository-code: "https://github.com/Felix77720/LSTM_MPC_DWA"
